<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>RPG on RaihnForge</title><link>https://RaihnForge.github.io/tags/rpg/</link><description>Recent content in RPG on RaihnForge</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://RaihnForge.github.io/tags/rpg/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Interactive SQL Visualizer — a Concept</title><link>https://RaihnForge.github.io/blog/interactive-sql-visualizer-concept/</link><pubDate>Sat, 09 Aug 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://RaihnForge.github.io/blog/interactive-sql-visualizer-concept/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This concept transforms SQL queries into visual events in a top-down RPG-style town visualizer. Every SQL command becomes a building, villager, or infrastructure change, creating a living, evolving data town.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="event-mapping"&gt;Event Mapping&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
	&lt;thead&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;SQL Concept&lt;/th&gt;
					&lt;th&gt;Visualizer Action&lt;/th&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/thead&gt;
	&lt;tbody&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;SELECT ... FROM&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Spawn a house for each table touched&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;WHERE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Draw roads to filtered houses&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;JOIN&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Build walls or bridges between table houses&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;GROUP BY&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Place a market square with stalls&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;ORDER BY&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Align road lights in sequence&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;INSERT&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Add villagers entering town&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;UPDATE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Upgrade a building level&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;DELETE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Demolish a structure&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;CREATE TABLE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Lay foundations&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
			&lt;tr&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;&lt;code&gt;DROP TABLE&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
					&lt;td&gt;Collapse ruins with a dust puff&lt;/td&gt;
			&lt;/tr&gt;
	&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h2 id="sample-visualizer-output"&gt;Sample Visualizer Output&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://RaihnForge.github.io/images/wp-imports/visualizer_proto.png" alt="Early prototype sketch"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>